<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέλεχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>,
			τό, also ὁ
		<i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>VH</u>
			1.8
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			10.166
		</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
			Alciphr.
			3.55
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crown of the
				root</i>, whence the stem or trunk springs, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρυὸς ἐν στελέχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					10.61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				60.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγειρος . . δεδιχασμένη ἑνὸς
				ἐκ στελέχους</span> Lyr. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Philol.</u>
				80.334
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>trunk, log</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στελέχη φέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					336
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπρεμνίζειν στελέχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					43.69
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσδυόμενος εἰς τὰ ς</span>.,
			of <i>hollow trunks</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				559a10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων ς. ἔτεκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hecat.
					15
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
			<i>blockhead</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lysipp.
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
